<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's QTC says issues dual samurai bond.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's QTC says issues dual samurai bond.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Queensland Treasury Corp (QTC) said it has issued a 10 billion yen three-year dual currency samurai bond which is redeemable in U.S. dollars.  </p>
<p>The bonds, which are issued at par, mature on February 28, 2000 and pay a 5.0 percent coupon in yen.</p>
<p>Settlement date is February 27, 1997 and the lead manager is Kokusai Securities.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
